  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix table layout -- header row was too long\r\n* Add a section to the README to explain how to integrate fuzzy finders by @IngoMeyer441 in https://github.com/naggie/dstask/pull/218\r\n* Support getting terminal size on windows by @philippbeckmann in https://github.com/naggie/dstask/pull/219\r\n* Add an advanced fzf integration for `dstask modify` and multi-select by @IngoMeyer441 in https://github.com/naggie/dstask/pull/220\r\n* fix P0 foreground color for tasks due now by @domlupo in https://github.com/naggie/dstask/pull/223\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @philippbeckmann made their first contribution in https://github.com/naggie/dstask/pull/219\r\n* @domlupo made their first contribution in https://github.com/naggie/dstask/pull/223\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/naggie/dstask/compare/1.0...v1.0.1",
